{"status":"ok","message-type":"work","message-version":"1.0.0","message":{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2025,10,8]],"date-time":"2025-10-08T22:24:08Z","timestamp":1759962248820},"reference-count":26,"publisher":"World Scientific Pub Co Pte Lt","issue":"01","content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"short-container-title":["Int. J. Math."],"published-print":{"date-parts":[[2014,1]]},"abstract":"<jats:p> We construct monads for framed torsion-free sheaves on blow-ups of the complex projective plane at finitely many distinct points. Using these monads we prove that the moduli space of such sheaves is a smooth algebraic variety. Moreover, we construct monads for families of such sheaves parametrized by a noetherian scheme S of finite type. A universal monad on the moduli space is introduced and used to prove that the moduli space is fine. </jats:p>","DOI":"10.1142/s0129167x14500086","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2014,1,6]],"date-time":"2014-01-06T04:06:13Z","timestamp":1388981173000},"page":"1450008","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":7,"title":["MONADS FOR FRAMED TORSION-FREE SHEAVES ON MULTI-BLOW-UPS OF THE PROJECTIVE PLANE"],"prefix":"10.1142","volume":"25","author":[{"given":"AMAR ABDELMOUBINE","family":"HENNI","sequence":"first","affiliation":[{"name":"Universidade Federal de Santa Catarina (UFSC), Departamento de Matemática, Florianópolis-SC, Brazil"}],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]}],"member":"219","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2014,2,9]]},"reference":[{"key":"rf1","first-page":"99","volume":"67","author":"Ancona V.","journal-title":"Atti Accad. Peloritana Pericolanti Cl. Sci. Fis. Mat. Natur."},{"key":"rf2","first-page":"157","volume":"3","author":"Ancona V.","journal-title":"Forum Math."},{"key":"rf3","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016/0375-9601(78)90141-X"},{"key":"rf4","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1007/978-3-642-96754-2"},{"key":"rf5","series-title":"Astérisque","volum